# The defect classes this distribution DECLARES (mtools:W629), planted one at a time by the
# `:mutants` runner: <module>|<name>|<pattern>|<replacement>|<scope>. A line that stops matching is a
# STALE declaration and fails the grid as UNAPPLIED.

